Crabforge third-party notices

Crabforge uses Google Sans and Noto Sans KR under the SIL Open Font License and uses HarmonyOS Sans SC under the HarmonyOS Sans Fonts License Agreement. The license texts are bundled with the application under desktop/data/flutter_assets/packages/crabforge_assets/fonts and can be viewed from About Crabforge.

Crabforge uses Google's Material Symbols Rounded under Apache License 2.0. The upstream font and license are recorded in assets/fonts/manifest.json. The license is also available from About Crabforge.

Windows distributions include Cargo registry license notices in licenses/rust and additional license texts in licenses/rust-upstream.txt. The latter cites the publishing commits for packages whose registry archives omitted those texts.

The provider catalog incorporates data from yetone's Magpie project. Brand artwork bundled with the desktop includes assets from Lobe Icons.

